}

docs {
  # Send Rating Reminders Manual
  
  Manually triggers the rating reminder process for testing purposes.
  This endpoint performs the same operations as the automated timer trigger:
  1. Auto-dismisses pending ratings older than 24 hours
  2. Creates pending ratings for households where it's currently 8pm
  3. Sends push notifications to household members
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a function key (admin/test endpoint only).
  
  ## Response
  Returns 200 OK when the process completes successfully.
  
  ## Notes
  - This is primarily for testing the rating reminder logic
  - The function uses household timezones to determine 8pm local time
  - Notifications are sent to all household members with recipes served today
}
